[{"client_msg_id":"dc0d1253-f777-4707-b4f9-8d5983874866","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ACPIをちょっといじったことあるのでわかるけど、機器都合にすごい触り回されるので、ベンダー同じでもどうしてもモデル差も厳しくなる...","ts":"1636017210.151500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desuyone","count":2,"users":["U8CC7MDCL","U01HXNSLCH5"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cb6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"789ffff3-99a7-4b42-b973-1d182321a015","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"DDST編集までしようとは思わないけどACPIまわりはほんと同じベンダーでもモデル違うだけで安定性違うからとてもつら…","ts":"1636017088.150500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vtO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66d3f6bc-1b7a-4fb2-9049-79c05ff8674b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"WoLはBIOSさんやネットワーク機器のお気持ち次第で使えたり使えなかったりするので諦めてる","ts":"1636017086.150400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1izD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"646c53d8-3bca-49de-8157-d1fe405bdbc6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"x86というCPUアーキテクチャすらも悪いともいえなくて、スリープという困難な状況に立ち向うACPIとそのハンドリングの功罪ってところかねえ...","ts":"1636016984.148500","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1636017006.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C6s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1606eaa5-2c2e-4037-a25b-fae8ea77aca7","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"Thinkpadが最近になって時々スリープから復帰しないようになって、Linuxのサスペンドの難しさを噛み締めてます","ts":"1636016873.147400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yWJRB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2508b42-b617-4ed1-b99d-fe272038c30b","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"S-stateによってWoL出来る出来ないも変わってきますね(S0~S5のあれ)\nなので `/etc/systemd/logind.conf` の `HandleLidSwitch` あたりをよしなにしてあげるといいと思います。","ts":"1636016742.146100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pmeS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f7c95fb-6b9d-40a3-8271-b6575d9d5fcf","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://mseeeen.msen.jp/how-to-avoid-sleep-on-pc-closing-with-centos-7/\u003e\n一応、閉じたときに suspend しないようにするには、systemd-logind なら、 `/etc/systemd/logind.conf` に `HandleLidSwitch=ignore` って書けば良いっぽいですが","ts":"1636016314.144300","attachments":[{"fallback":"CentOS 7でノートPCを閉じてもスリープさせない方法","id":1,"title":"CentOS 7でノートPCを閉じてもスリープさせない方法","title_link":"https://mseeeen.msen.jp/how-to-avoid-sleep-on-pc-closing-with-centos-7/","text":"こんにちは。 今回は、ノートPCにインストールしたCentOS 7の環境で、ノートPCを閉じてもスリープにさせない（起動させた状態を維持する）方法を紹介します。 閉じるとスリープになる 初期状態はどうなるか確認してみます。 IPアドレスが、192.168.11.161 と分かったので、同じネットワークのWindows…","thumb_url":"https://mseeeen.msen.jp/static/fe4d17f25bcf63d7c56af0898122ecf2/how-to-avoid-sleep-on-pc-closing-with-centos-7.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"mseeeen.msen.jp","service_icon":"https://mseeeen.msen.jp/icons/icon-48x48.png?v=f9d938c902120634718eb1593b53191a","thumb_width":737,"thumb_height":495,"from_url":"https://mseeeen.msen.jp/how-to-avoid-sleep-on-pc-closing-with-centos-7/","original_url":"https://mseeeen.msen.jp/how-to-avoid-sleep-on-pc-closing-with-centos-7/"}],"edited":{"user":"U06ECBRTJ","ts":"1636016325.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pWevs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e40eaed-287f-42ea-aeae-eb21d80a808b","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"Linux の Suspend や Sleep って何種類かあるので難しいですね","ts":"1636016176.143200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fpF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ba3d673-a16d-40c8-8095-25a8fd5dce33","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"wowlan (Wireless wake on lan) 設定して動くんですが、閉じた時は動かないんですよね。","ts":"1636015704.142500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ho4o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e0ae9e2-c059-436e-b309-fa9a37688313","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Linux で /sys/power/state に mem とか書くのと、ラップトップ閉じた時の suspend って違うもんなんですかね。","ts":"1636015673.141900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wZBin"}]}]
